{
  "tema": 7068,
  "slug": "cuanto-sustantivo-pregunta",
  "titulo": "Cuánto + noun: how much, how many",
  "subtitulo": "¿Cuánto dinero? ¿Cuántas olas?",
  "foto": "t05.jpg",
  "regla": "Cuánto + noun asks how much / how many and agrees with the noun: cuánto, cuánta, cuántos, cuántas. Singular for things you can't count, plural for things you can. Always with an accent.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": null,
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "To ask _how much_ or _how many_ before a noun, use **cuánto**. Here it's an adjective, so it **agrees** with the noun in gender and number."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "",
            "Singular (how much)",
            "Plural (how many)"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "Masculine",
              "¿cuánto dinero?",
              "¿cuántos años?"
            ],
            [
              "Feminine",
              "¿cuánta agua?",
              "¿cuántas personas?"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Singular for things you can't count (**dinero, agua, tiempo, gente**), plural for things you can (**olas, clases, hermanos**)."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Agua** is feminine (it only takes **el** for sound): **¿cuánta agua?** **Gente** is singular and feminine: **¿cuánta gente?**"
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "The accent stays in indirect questions too: **No sé cuántos años tiene.**"
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **cuánto** is a mirror. It copies the **-o, -a, -os, -as** of its noun."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "¿==Cuánto== dinero necesitas para la tabla?",
              "en": "How much money do you need for the board?"
